      "allow": [
        "rect.y",
        "rect.h",
        "fontWeight"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "bell",
      "artboard": "header a[aria-label^=Messages]",
      "page": ".av-shell__bell",
      "allow": [
        "rect.x",
        "rect.y",
        "rect.w",
        "rect.h"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "avatar",
      "artboard": "header > div > span",
      "page": ".av-shell__avatar-disc",
      "allow": [
        "rect.x"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "title",
      "artboard": "h1",
      "page": ".av-today__title",
      "allow": [
        "rect.w"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "new case",
      "artboard": "main > div:first-child > a",
      "page": ".av-today__new"
    },
    {
      "name": "needs card",
      "artboard": "main > section:nth-of-type(1)",
      "page": ".av-needs-card"
    },
    {
      "name": "needs row 1",
      "artboard": "main > section:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1)",
      "page": ".av-needs__item:nth-child(1)"
    },
    {
      "name": "cases heading",
      "artboard": "main > section:nth-of-type(2) h2",
      "page": "#your-cases"
    },
    {
      "name": "filter",
      "artboard": "[role=group]",
      "page": ".av-filter",
      "allow": [
        "rect.x",
        "rect.w",
        "rect.h"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "card 1",
      "artboard": "main > section:nth-of-type(2) > div:nth-of-type(2) > a:nth-child(1)",
      "page": ".av-cases li:nth-child(1) a"
    },
    {
      "name": "card 4",
      "artboard": "main > section:nth-of-type(2) > div:nth-of-type(2) > a:nth-child(4)",
      "page": ".av-cases li:nth-child(4) a"
    },
    {
      "name": "footer",
      "artboard": "main > p",
      "page": ".av-today__balance",
      "allow": [
        "rect.y"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "deviations": [
    "Nav links, the bell and the avatar keep 52px touch targets (rule: buttons at least 52px); the canvas draws them 44-46px. The visible chip is the canvas size.",
    "The header has a Help link the canvas omits, which shifts the bell and avatar left by 40px.",
    "The page's header background sits on .av-shell__header, the artboard's on the bar itself.",
    "The board's detail lines under each needs-you row, the case subtitles, the org tag on a needs-you row, the first card's 2px highlight and the bell's unread count have no data in the API: the artboard is rendered without them (artboardCss/artboardRemove).",
    "Filter chips are drawn at the board's 41px with a transparent 52px hit area; the filter's x/width differ because the card badge and the chip both use organisation_name (mock 'Northgate'; the board uses 'Northgate' on the badge and 'Northgate Medico-Legal' on the chip).",
    "The first needs-you row is the primary button (rank order); the board makes the second one primary.",
    "Shell bar height 75px vs 76px on the board is left to the header owner; the body is 2px high as a result."
  ],
